    "detailed_description": "Hard Vacuum is a single-player space combat game developed from the ground up for virtual reality. It features fully interactive cockpits using motion controllers or using a gaze system in combination with a HOTAS or gamepad.<br><br>Try the demo!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280940/extras/eede0da8da040f27094281582c541940.poster.avif?t=1621276453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280940/extras/eede0da8da040f27094281582c541940.webm?t=1621276453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280940/extras/eede0da8da040f27094281582c541940.mp4?t=1621276453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three flyable ships with fully interactive cockpits<br></li><li>Fly with motion controllers, HOTAS or gamepad<br></li><li>Newtonian physics - toggle flight assist on or off<br></li><li>AI wingmen with a streamlined command system<br></li><li>Unlock new weapons and upgrade ship systems</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game modes:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A narrative-driven campaign featuring a diverse range of scenarios<br></li><li>Mercenary - a dynamic campaign with randomised missions. Earn credits and upgrade your ship and wingmen on your path to a final confrontation<br></li><li>Sustain:  Hold out against multiple waves of hostile craft</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Hard Vacuum is a single-player space combat game developed from the ground up for virtual reality. It features fully interactive cockpits using motion controllers or using a gaze system in combination with a HOTAS or gamepad.<br><br>Try the demo!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280940/extras/eede0da8da040f27094281582c541940.poster.avif?t=1621276453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280940/extras/eede0da8da040f27094281582c541940.webm?t=1621276453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280940/extras/eede0da8da040f27094281582c541940.mp4?t=1621276453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three flyable ships with fully interactive cockpits<br></li><li>Fly with motion controllers, HOTAS or gamepad<br></li><li>Newtonian physics - toggle flight assist on or off<br></li><li>AI wingmen with a streamlined command system<br></li><li>Unlock new weapons and upgrade ship systems</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game modes:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A narrative-driven campaign featuring a diverse range of scenarios<br></li><li>Mercenary - a dynamic campaign with randomised missions. Earn credits and upgrade your ship and wingmen on your path to a final confrontation<br></li><li>Sustain:  Hold out against multiple waves of hostile craft</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hard Vacuum is a single-player space combat game developed from the ground up for virtual reality. Be the pilot of a starfighter with a fully interactive cockpit.",
